<aside class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 my-16">
  <div class="relative bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-600 via-sky-500 to-indigo-600 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 text-white shadow-xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
    <!-- Decorative Icon Background -->
    <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 opacity-10 text-[180px] pointer-events-none select-none">
      ✈️
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-xl text-center md:text-left">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/20 backdrop-blur text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
        ⚡ Nu rata niciun chilipir
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight mb-2">
        Biletele la 20-30€ se vând în câteva ore!
      </h3>
      <p class="text-sky-100 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        Companiile aeriene își modifică prețurile în timp real. Alătură-te gratuit pe canalul nostru de Telegram și primești o alertă pe telefon în secunda în care publicăm un zbor ieftin.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 flex-shrink-0">
      <a 
        href="https://t.me" 
        target="_blank" 
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 text-sky-600 font-extrabold text-sm sm:text-base shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm4.64 6.8c-.15 1.58-.8 5.42-1.13 7.19-.14.75-.42 1-.68 1.03-.58.05-1.02-.38-1.58-.75-.88-.58-1.38-.94-2.23-1.5-.99-.65-.35-1.01.22-1.59.15-.15 2.71-2.48 2.76-2.69a.2.2 0 00-.05-.18c-.06-.05-.14-.03-.21-.02-.09.02-1.49.95-4.22 2.79-.4.27-.76.41-1.08.4-.36-.01-1.04-.2-1.55-.37-.63-.2-1.12-.31-1.08-.66.02-.18.27-.36.74-.55 2.92-1.27 4.86-2.11 5.83-2.52 2.77-1.16 3.35-1.36 3.73-1.36.08 0 .27.02.39.12.1.08.13.19.14.27-.01.06.01.24 0 .38z"/>
        </svg>
        <span>Intră pe Canalul Telegram</span>
